create service offerings to optimize for customers the design,
implementation and management of the Compaq and Oracle E-Business Platform.
Compaq and Oracle are plan to jointly develop service offerings, such as
architecture analysis and design consulting, and implement global training
programs for their consulting organizations to jointly deliver Compaq and
Oracle E-Business Platform-based products running across Compaq servers. 

