You can run the PT440s in Sun emulation mode. Meaning it will use the 
Solaris isp driver instead of the ptisp driver. Emulation is enabled by
flipping the (miniature) switch 1 of the 4 switch dipswitch.

Alternatively you can find yourself a Sun X1062A or X1065A adapter. 
But emulation works fine.

