This sounds like you're in SRM and the Multia is OK, but your monitor
can't display whatever video mode the Multia is trying to use.  I've seen
this before on my own Multia.

You can try one of the following:
- Set the Multia video mode jumpers to match your monitor.
- Assume when you see that wiggling scrambled text that you're in SRM and
  try to get back into ARC.  I think it's as simple as typing in "ARC".
- Connect a different multisync monitor.
