Quite.

>But I still have questions :
>1) For each port, there is a LED.  For some reason this LED is always green
>     on some connected port but is flashing for someother.  What does mean
>the
>    different indication type ( flashing / off / on )


If it is on, an error of some kind was detected by the unit. Flashing
indicates that an error
was present but now gone. Off indicates a normal condition.

>2) There is a switch at the extreme right.  This "seems" like a reset but I
>would like
>    to be sure of the function of that gizmo.


It briefly resets the AUI port and the UTP ports and switches off status
LEDS. This won't affect attached equipment.

