It occurred to me that since you seem to have an OpenVMS Hobbyist licence, you 
might find it easier to cluster the two VAXen, at least temporarily.

Then your 3600 can boot off the 3100, you init the RA70, you restore saveset B 
to the RA70, you copy the savesets to [000000] on the RA70 and then you 
shutdown the 3600 and reboot off the RA70. The VMS installation will ask where 
the savesets are and then it should all just work.

