The information from the MVII manual states a heat dissipation of:

5872 Btu/hr for the 120Vac 
6022 Btu/hr for the 240Vac mode. 

That page doesn't seem to specify what sort of config is included. But it
indicates power consumption of 16.4 A typical and 26.1 max. (for 110V).

