Get your friendly electrician to put a clamp across the feed to the
cabinet
to measure the draw of the cabinet.  From the draw you can get watts and
from watts you can get BTU's directly.  You will find the resultant heat
load
to be significantly different from the published heat load.

Regards,

Bill

